        "content": "# Celiac Disease Antibody Panel\n\nBased on the clinical presentation, this is the recommended first-line evaluation. Testing should include IgA tTG antibody with reflex to IgA endomysial antibody for confirmation. Total IgA should be measured concurrently to rule out selective IgA deficiency, which occurs in ~2–3% of celiac patients and causes false-negative tTG results."
